   "updated": 1791504000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Existing base, free and paid, both brands:\n- PushOwl: Intercom email, post, banner,\n   chat\n- Brevo ecom: Brevo email + Intercom post,\n   banner, chat on Brevo\n- In-app: banners, pricing section, BFCM\n   product page\n- Webinars, remarketing for free and paid",
   "originalText": "Existing base, free and paid, both brands:\n- PushOwl: Intercom email, post, banner,\n   chat\n- Brevo ecom: Brevo email + Intercom post,\n   banner, chat on Brevo\n- In-app: banners, pricing section, BFCM\n   product page\n- Webinars, remarketing for free and paid",
