   "text": "cohort 1: new from paid traffic (PPC, creators, PR)\n> LP / Brevo BFCM page\ncohort 2: new from non-paid traffic after 10 Oct\ncohort 3: existing free users\ncohort 4: existing paid users, one segment each",
