   "updated": 1791504000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "webinars (Farooq + Anand, 11 am ET, replays on the\nBFCM product page):\n- Shopify co-webinars x2 (Oct): new merchants, LP\n   link + \"deal opens 2 Nov\"\n- W2 pop-ups and opt-ins: on demand 20 Oct, free +\n   new\n- W1 BFCM deliverability: live Thu 29 Oct, existing\n   base, free + paid\n- W3 Black Friday done for you: live Tue 10 Nov,\n   free + new + leads > claim + book setup\n- W4 SMS for BFCM: live Thu 12 Nov, paid with no or\n   little SMS > SMS top-up",
   "originalText": "webinars (Farooq + Anand, 11 am ET, replays on the\nBFCM product page):\n- Shopify co-webinars x2 (Oct): new merchants, LP\n   link + \"deal opens 2 Nov\"\n- W2 pop-ups and opt-ins: on demand 20 Oct, free +\n   new\n- W1 BFCM deliverability: live Thu 29 Oct, existing\n   base, free + paid\n- W3 Black Friday done for you: live Tue 10 Nov,\n   free + new + leads > claim + book setup\n- W4 SMS for BFCM: live Thu 12 Nov, paid with no or\n   little SMS > SMS top-up",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 5,
