   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Code: NO, never on what they already pay\nPushOwl, one series each:\n- Orders > 50k: managed services call (sales)\n- Power, Enterprise: custom upgrade, chat\n   routes to sales\n- Overconsumption 70/90/100%: upgrade\n- No SMS, plan > $299: one-time SMS top-up\n- Push without email: x% off email for 3 cycles\n- Monthly to annual: x% off\nBrevo Pro: orders > 10k managed services, no or\nlittle SMS: SMS upsell, custom upgrade;\nStarter/Business: monthly to annual",
   "originalText": "Code: NO, never on what they already pay\nPushOwl, one series each:\n- Orders > 50k: managed services call (sales)\n- Power, Enterprise: custom upgrade, chat\n   routes to sales\n- Overconsumption 70/90/100%: upgrade\n- No SMS, plan > $299: one-time SMS top-up\n- Push without email: x% off email for 3 cycles\n- Monthly to annual: x% off\nBrevo Pro: orders > 10k managed services, no or\nlittle SMS: SMS upsell, custom upgrade;\nStarter/Business: monthly to annual",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
